## Responsibility Decomposition
Complete this before placement or slicing. Use one row per independently meaningful owner; one row is enough for a simple cohesive change. `Existing/New` is `Existing` or `New`. `Reuse Decision` is `REUSE`, `EXTEND`, `REFACTOR`, or `NEW`, followed by `: inspected evidence; rationale`. Name rules, workflows, mappings, capabilities, and integrations explicitly; a layer, slice, or nearby generic file is not an owner.

