## Applicable Support Envelope
For risky behavior, state the supported inputs and limits, identity semantics, ordering, cancellation, re-registration, shutdown, concurrency, and scale guarantees that apply. Mark irrelevant dimensions as not applicable and keep unsupported horizons out of the implementation contract.

